# Shared engine → one ES module (dist/drum-engine.js) for the React, Vue
# and Angular builds. The Haxe front end compiles src/ in directly instead.
# Build: haxe build.hxml   (from this folder; needs Node for the last step)

-cp src
-D js-es=6
-dce full
-js dist/drum-engine.haxe.js
drum.DrumMachine
drum.panel.PanelText
drum.panel.SevenSegmentFont
drum.panel.ShareLink

# Haxe writes a classic script; this turns it into an ES module.
--cmd node tools/to-es-module.mjs dist/drum-engine.haxe.js dist/drum-engine.js
